# Convex
.env.local

# Convex AI scaffolding, regenerated by `npx convex dev`.
# Not project documentation — the team's docs live in docs/ and the root
# CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md. convex/_generated IS committed: the Render build
# imports from it and never runs `convex dev`.
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Copied from harness/harness.html by scripts/copy-harness.mjs on predev and
# prebuild. Committing it would leave two copies to drift apart.
/public/harness.html

# Stray tsc output next to the Convex sources. Anchored to this directory only:
# convex/_generated/*.js is committed on purpose, since the Render build imports
# from it and never runs `npx convex dev`.
/convex/*.js
